 "comments": [
  {
   "rating": 26,
   "date": "2006-01-08T09:08:18-06:00",
   "body": "they can all be found at 35,35. solo'd at levl 9 priest. Just be patient and pull one by one.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 14,
   "date": "2006-04-27T21:08:18-05:00",
   "body": "There are lower lvl's at /tloc 37,42. (lvls 8-10)",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 11,
   "date": "2007-03-21T01:26:11-05:00",
   "body": "These guys appear at 36,34 and northward. They are fairly bunched up so the chance for adds is great. Casters sprinkled in there, as well.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 8,
   "date": "2007-01-08T09:08:18-06:00",
   "body": "As I was coming from Darnassus, I headed up the road & kept an eye our for the creatures to the left hand side. I killed heaps. I got a chest too. After I got them all, I got another chest & box from the area and killed the rare one for fun. Not exciting drops",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 7,
   "date": "2007-03-19T12:58:42-05:00",
   "body": "Is this NElf only or have a requirement?&nbsp; This Draeni can't even talk to the questgiver. :'(",
   "replies": [
    "You can only get this quest after doing a moonwell chain."
   ]
  },
  {
   "rating": 7,
   "date": "2005-08-22T23:35:57-05:00",
   "body": "No coins, but gained 440XP (at lvl 9, just shy of making 10) and a slight Darnassus Faction increase.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 6,
   "date": "2006-04-27T21:08:18-05:00",
   "body": "it was really easy as a 14 druid just watch out for the gray elite straight west of the quest giver",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 3,
   "date": "2007-02-13T21:08:18-06:00",
   "body": "Fun quest - Solo'd this as a level 8 hunter.&nbsp; Just pull them one by one and you'll be ok.&nbsp; Good Luck!",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 2,
   "date": "2007-02-01T17:06:45-06:00",
   "body": "The location is:\n\n[b]Continent[/b]: Kalimdor\n[b]Zone[/b]: Teldrassil\n[b]Coordinates[/b]: The monsters are at the west side of the road leading to the Oracle Glade. (around 38, 42)\n[b]Where?[/b]: At south-west of Oracle Glade\n\nThe monsters are white and red coloured, names: Bloodfeather Harpy and Bloodfeather sorceress.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 2,
   "date": "2020-04-11T15:47:00-05:00",
   "body": "\"I have noticed the Oracle Tree has just shed a piece of its bark. No doubt it has a task that it wishes completed. You should speak with it.\"\r\n\r\nAnyone knows what that means? The tree isn't clickable or anything.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2005-06-26T09:21:42-05:00",
   "body": "37,43",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2005-11-25T21:50:59-06:00",
   "body": "The drop rates for the belts seems to be better on the Bloodfeather Wind Witches and Matriarchs to the west of the Oracle Tree. I managed to get five of the six belts just making my way to find Mist for another quest, and I only killed about six harpies. But for the last belt I tried the Harpies, Rogues, and Sorceresses that are near the road, and I had to kill four or five to get one belt.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 0,
   "date": "2007-03-22T13:56:18-05:00",
   "body": "just solo'd with a lvl 8 priest.&nbsp; might need to bubble a little if ur new, gl :)",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": -5,
   "date": "2005-10-27T09:08:18-05:00",
   "body": "Hey, im a lvl 11 druid, is it easy to rescue mist? And also which item did u pick on the enchanted glade quest?",
   "replies": [
    "At the end of this quest:\n\n[b]\"I have noticed the Oracle Tree has just shed a piece of its bark. No doubt it has a task that it wishes completed. You should speak with it.\"[/b]\n\nBut all I see is that she starts the next quest...although her dialogue sounds like it would come from the oracle tree itself, but I can't find any oracle tree to speak to.&nbsp; She herself actually starts the next quest (but not in a direct chain).&nbsp; What's up with that?"
   ]
  },
